WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.848
Lady: Here you go.

2
00:00:04.849 --> 00:00:07.177
Sam: Thanks. Look, Lilly.

3
00:00:07.178 --> 00:00:10.330
I have my own library card! Lilly:

4
00:00:10.331 --> 00:00:14.634
Book! Book! Dad:

5
00:00:14.635 --> 00:00:17.673
I'm going to find some books for Lilly.

6
00:00:17.674 --> 00:00:19.287
Why don't you look over there? Sam:

7
00:00:19.288 --> 00:00:21.763
Okay. Dad:

8
00:00:21.764 --> 00:00:23.503
What did you get? Sam:

9
00:00:23.504 --> 00:00:26.265
I got some dog books to show Kate. And

10
00:00:26.266 --> 00:00:28.602
here's one about fishing. Dad: Hey!

11
00:00:28.603 --> 00:00:31.073
I have an idea. Sam:

12
00:00:31.074 --> 00:00:32.545
What, Dad? Dad:

13
00:00:32.546 --> 00:00:35.804
Let's go fishing. We can take the boat. Sam:

14
00:00:35.805 --> 00:00:37.448
Can Lucky come? Dad:

15
00:00:37.449 --> 00:00:41.513
Sure. Sam:

16
00:00:41.514 --> 00:00:48.263
We're here. Time to go fishing, Lucky! Dad:

17
00:00:48.264 --> 00:00:51.074
First, put the bait on the hook. Then,

18
00:00:51.075 --> 00:00:53.353
throw out your line. Sam:

19
00:00:53.354 --> 00:00:59.149
I remember. Look, Dad! Lucky is swimming! Dad:

20
00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:07.681
That silly dog! Sam:

21
00:01:07.682 --> 00:01:11.111
The fish are not biting today. Dad:

22
00:01:11.112 --> 00:01:16.473
Maybe Lucky is scaring them away. Sam:

23
00:01:16.474 --> 00:01:19.769
Hey! I got something! Dad:

24
00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:27.003
Reel it in! Wow! It's a big one!

25
00:01:27.004 --> 00:01:31.006
Sam: Look, Lucky! I got a fish!

26
00:01:31.007 --> 00:01:38.328
Dad: He caught something too. A crab!

